{
  "format": "demo-disk/song",
  "version": 2,
  "name": "WORLD LOOP",
  "what": "World house, A with B flat and C sharp, 120 BPM. A DJ loop of the samplers, after SPICE ROAD's turn: the kick on every beat, the darbuka with tabla strokes between, the UPRIGHT on A and E, the FLUTE's melody round B flat and C sharp (they leave the other loops' pentatonic notes, so mix its drums and bass with theirs, not its flute with their hooks)",
